  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Conflict Sensitivity Hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to establish a Conflict Sensitivity Hub in Ethiopia to enhance the ability of Humanitarian, Development, and Peacebuilding (HDP) actors to recognise and mitigate the risks of inadvertently fuelling conflict and to adjust programming to better support peacebuilding.</narrative>
  </description>
